\[main\.pointer_dereference\.\d+\] line \d+ dereference failure: pointer outside dynamic object bounds in a\[(\(signed (long|long long) int\))?i\]: SUCCESS
\[main\.assertion.2] line \d+ assertion __CPROVER_forall \{ int j; \!\(0 <= j && j < 1\) || \(j == 0 && \*\(a\+j\) == \*\(a+j\)\) \}: SUCCESS
\[main\.pointer_dereference\.\d+] line \d+ dereference failure: pointer NULL in a\[(\(signed (long|long long) int\))?j\]: SUCCESS
